  "summary": "The paper proposes using GPT‑4.1 to generate hardware‑aware QCBM ansätze for financial generative modeling of Japanese government bond interest rates. On a 12‑qubit IBM ibm_fez processor, the LLM‑generated circuit (depth 28) achieves KL divergence 6.91±0.13 with measurement error mitigation, outperforming the deeper TwoLocal baseline (depth ≈85, KL 8.92±0.07) while using substantially shallower circuits.",
